        <p><strong>Planet:</strong> ♃ Guru (Jupiter) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Governs:</strong> Wisdom, learning, prosperity, judgment, and ethical growth</p>
        <p>Citrine is a gemstone associated with Jupiter (Guru), the planet of understanding, expansion, and abundance. While not a primary Jupiter gemstone like Yellow Sapphire, Citrine is often considered a gentler alternative that brings Jupiter's qualities in a more accessible and balanced form.</p>
        <p>Unlike Yellow Sapphire, which carries stronger intensity, Citrine works with warmth and ease. It supports confidence without arrogance, encourages progress without pressure, and helps align growth with clarity and sound judgment. Its effect is steady, uplifting, and sustainable.</p>
        <p>Citrine aligns with Jupiter's energy to promote wisdom, optimism, and balanced prosperity. It encourages better decision-making, supports learning, and helps create direction where growth may feel uncertain or inconsistent.</p>
        <p>It is particularly suited for students, teachers, advisors, consultants, and individuals focused on steady personal or professional development. It may be considered during Guru Mahadasha or Antardasha when clarity is lacking, confidence feels inconsistent, or progress has slowed.</p>
