        <p><strong>Planets:</strong> ♃ Guru (Jupiter) · ♀ Shukra (Venus) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Governs:</strong> Wisdom, protection, harmony, calm, and emotional balance</p>
        <p>Turquoise is a gemstone associated with both Jupiter (Guru) and Venus (Shukra), combining qualities of wisdom, protection, and emotional harmony. Unlike primary planetary stones, Firoza offers a gentler and more accessible expression of these energies, making it suitable for those who seek balance without intensity.</p>
        <p>Rather than amplifying force, Turquoise works by calming and grounding. It supports emotional stability, reduces anxiety and restlessness, and creates a sense of protective reassurance. Its influence is subtle yet steady, helping individuals navigate stress and uncertainty with greater ease.</p>
        <p>Turquoise aligns with the combined energies of Jupiter and Venus to promote clarity, comfort, and harmonious living. It encourages balanced thinking, emotional steadiness, and a softer, more composed approach to challenges and relationships.</p>
        <p>It is particularly suited for individuals dealing with stress, frequent travel, or high-pressure environments, as well as those seeking protection and emotional grounding. It may also be considered when stronger Jupiter or Venus gemstones feel too intense or have been advised against.</p>
        <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #c53030; margin-top: 20px;">
          <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> Gemstone selection should always be guided by individual horoscope analysis and expert advice. Even gentle stones should be chosen with proper consideration.</p>
        </div>
