        <p><strong>Planet:</strong> ☉ Surya (Sun) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Governs:</strong> Vitality, authority, leadership, self-expression, and life force</p>
        <p>Surya represents the Sun — the source of energy, identity, and direction in Vedic astrology. This page is dedicated to the astrological world of the Sun, its gemstone Ruby (Manik), and its influence on confidence, leadership, and purpose.</p>
        <p>Ruby is the primary gemstone of Surya. It is worn to strengthen Sun energy in the horoscope, supporting authority, decisiveness, and a clear sense of self.</p>
