        <p>Chandra represents the Moon — the planet that governs our emotional world, intuition, and inner rhythm in Vedic astrology. This page is dedicated to the astrological world of the Moon, its gemstone Pearl (Moti), and its influence on mental peace and emotional stability.</p>
        <p>Pearl is the primary gemstone of Chandra. It is worn to bring calmness to the mind, stabilise emotions, and support clearer thinking and restful sleep.</p>
