        <p>Mangal represents Mars — the planet of action, strength, and execution in Vedic astrology. This page is dedicated to the astrological world of Mars, its gemstone Red Coral (Moonga), and its influence on energy, courage, and purposeful action.</p>
        <p>Red Coral is the primary gemstone of Mangal. It is worn to channel Mars energy constructively — supporting stamina, decisiveness, and grounded strength.</p>
