        <p>Budh represents Mercury — the planet of intelligence, speech, logic, and decision-making in Vedic astrology. This page is dedicated to the astrological world of Mercury, its gemstone Emerald (Panna), and its influence on mental clarity and communication.</p>
        <p>Emerald is the primary gemstone of Budh. It is worn to enhance mental clarity, improve communication skills, and bring sharper focus in personal and professional life.</p>
