        <p>Shukra represents Venus — the planet of harmony, aesthetics, and emotional connection in Vedic astrology. This page is dedicated to the astrological world of Venus, its gemstones White Sapphire and Opal, and their influence on relationships, creativity, and emotional balance.</p>
        <p>White Sapphire and Opal are the primary gemstones of Shukra. They are worn to enhance grace, emotional equilibrium, and harmonious living.</p>
