        <p>Guru represents Jupiter — the planet of understanding, expansion, and higher knowledge in Vedic astrology. This page is dedicated to the astrological world of Jupiter, its gemstone Yellow Sapphire (Pukhraj), and its influence on wisdom, prosperity, and clarity.</p>
        <p>Yellow Sapphire is the primary gemstone of Guru. It is worn to enhance discernment, improve judgment, and align growth with sound understanding.</p>
