        <p>Shani represents Saturn — the planet of karma, structure, perseverance, and responsibility in Vedic astrology. This page is dedicated to the astrological world of Saturn, its gemstone Blue Sapphire (Neelam), and its influence on discipline, stability, and sustained success.</p>
