        <p>Rahu is a shadow planet known for its intense, unconventional, and often unpredictable influence in Vedic astrology. This page is dedicated to the astrological world of Rahu, its gemstone Hessonite (Gomed), and its influence on ambition, clarity, and transformation.</p>
        <p>Hessonite is the primary gemstone of Rahu. It is worn to stabilise perception, improve judgment, and channel scattered ambition into focused intent.</p>
