        <p><strong>Planet:</strong> ☋ Ketu &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Governs:</strong> Spirituality, detachment, liberation, and karmic correction</p>
        <p>Ketu is a shadow planet known for its subtle yet powerful influence on spirituality, detachment, and karmic resolution in Vedic astrology. This page is dedicated to the astrological world of Ketu, its gemstone Cat's Eye (Lehsunia), and its influence on inner clarity and protection.</p>
        <p>Cat's Eye is the primary gemstone of Ketu. It is worn to sharpen perception, enhance intuition, and provide protection against unseen disturbances.</p>
        <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid #c53030; margin-top: 20px;">
