        <p>Iolite, also known as cordierite or the "Viking's compass," is associated with Saturn and Rahu energy. It is valued as a substitute for Blue Sapphire or Hessonite, offering inner guidance, enhanced vision, and the ability to navigate uncertainty with clarity.</p>
        <p>It is particularly suited for those seeking a gentler Saturn or Rahu remedy, or for individuals in creative, intuitive, or leadership roles who need steady direction.</p>
