        <p>Pitambari Sapphire is a rare bi-colour sapphire displaying both yellow and blue in a single stone — combining the energies of Jupiter (Guru) and Saturn (Shani) simultaneously. It is considered highly auspicious in Vedic astrology for those whose charts benefit from both planetary influences.</p>
